@*
    New to .cshtml? See Projects/RAZOR_BASICS.md.

    ViewBag.SavedFiles is the list of file names that UploadController.Index() put in the ViewBag.
    ViewBag is a "bag" of values the controller fills and the view reads, for this request only.
*@
<h2>Uploaded files</h2>
@* "~/" = site root (wwwroot). "~/uploads/abc.png" becomes "/uploads/abc.png", served by UseStaticFiles. *@
<ul>
    @* @foreach is a normal C# loop: the <li> is written once per file name. *@
    @foreach (string fileName in ViewBag.SavedFiles)
    {
        <li><a href="~/uploads/@fileName">@fileName</a></li>
    }
</ul>
